flowchart TB
Accept[Persist business action] --> Queue[Transactional jobs or deletion outbox]
Queue --> Claim[FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED bounded claim]
Claim --> Execute[Attempt count increment and finite execution]
Execute --> Success[Provider accepted or storage deleted]
Execute --> Retry[Failure - delayed exponential retry]
Retry --> Limit{Attempts below five?}
Limit -->|yes| Queue
Limit -->|no| Failed[Terminal failed state - investigate safely]
Crash[Crash or shutdown] --> Lease[Stale running lease expires after five minutes]
Lease --> Limit
SIG[Graceful shutdown] --> Stop[Stop new claims and finish bounded work]
Scan[Quarantined files scan separately] --> Keep[Error keeps quarantine and emits scan_failed]
